7592186245538 1145 "The derivative of the natural logarithm is the reciprocal function:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(ln⁡x)=\\frac{1}{x}\n$$\n\nWe apply our formula and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-\\frac{7}{3}ln⁡x) \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{3}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(ln⁡x) \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{x} \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{3x}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245539 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245540 13194139533669 true] [17592186245539 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533669 true] [17592186245539 1041 "field-1" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245539 1104 #edb/ref 17592186245540 13194139533669 true] [17592186245539 1110 #uuid "6388562b-2b4c-50ea-b269-9fc34ebf91c7" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245540 1034 "-\\frac{7}{3x}" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245540 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533669 true] [17592186245540 1111 #uuid "e2ad5a6f-3194-5f3a-9982-fd2336c2ddec" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245541 1017 #edb/ref 17592186245542 13194139533669 true] [17592186245541 1089 "q-339994" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245541 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533669 true] [17592186245541 1100 "Given the function $y=2{x}^{3}+x-3{log}_{6}⁡x,$ find the instantaneous rate of change at $x=3.$ Do not round the answer.\n\nThe instantaneous rate of change at $x=3$ is\n{{field-1}}." 13194139533669 true] [17592186245541 1113 #uuid "ce4d4f97-d868-5d04-a9b5-17c6975fb577" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245541 1138 false 13194139533669 true] [17592186245541 1145 "To differentiate a logarithm with base $a,$ we use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({log}_{a}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{xln⁡a}.\n$$\n\nTo find the instantaneous rate of change at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nTaking the derivative we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{3}+x-3{log}_{6}⁡x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot 3{x}^{2}+1-3\\cdot \\frac{1}{xln⁡6} \\\\  & =6{x}^{2}+1-\\frac{3}{xln⁡6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the instantaneous rate of change at $x=3$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=3} & ={(6{x}^{2}+1-\\frac{3}{xln⁡6})|}_{x=3} \\\\  & =6(3)^{2}+1-\\frac{3}{3\\cdot ln⁡6} \\\\  & =55-\\frac{1}{ln⁡6}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245543 13194139533669 true] [17592186245542 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245544 13194139533669 true] [17592186245542 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533669 true] [17592186245542 1041 "field-1" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245542 1104 #edb/ref 17592186245544 13194139533669 true] [17592186245542 1110 #uuid "2e517cf4-1992-5a23-8a87-f2a675cf83b1" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245543 1034 "55+\\frac{1}{\\ln(6)}" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245543 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533669 true] [17592186245543 1111 #uuid "28ba94f1-8641-5046-815b-84bde6bb5f82" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245544 1034 "55-\\frac{1}{\\ln(6)}" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245544 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533669 true] [17592186245544 1111 #uuid "f9e2ea69-8c24-540e-922a-84258e3995fd" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245545 1017 #edb/ref 17592186245546 13194139533669 true] [17592186245545 1089 "q-340024" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245545 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533669 true] [17592186245545 1100 "Given the function $y=2{x}^{3}-5{log}_{3}⁡x,$ the slope of the tangent line at $x=2$ is{{field-1}}." 13194139533669 true] [17592186245545 1113 #uuid "13209240-47ee-57bb-950d-c7141b5c2f2d" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245545 1138 false 13194139533669 true] [17592186245545 1145 "To find the slope of the tangent at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nTaking the derivative, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{3}-5{log}_{3}⁡x) \\\\  & =2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3})-5\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({log}_{3}⁡x) \\\\  & =2\\cdot 3{x}^{2}-5\\cdot \\frac{1}{xln⁡3} \\\\  & =6{x}^{2}-\\frac{5}{xln⁡3}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent at $x=2$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=2} & ={(6{x}^{2}-\\frac{5}{xln⁡3})|}_{x=2} \\\\  & =6(2)^{2}-\\frac{5}{2ln⁡3} \\\\  & =24-\\frac{5}{2ln⁡3}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245546 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245547 13194139533669 true] [17592186245546 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533669 true] [17592186245546 1041 "field-1" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245546 1104 #edb/ref 17592186245547 13194139533669 true] [17592186245546 1110 #uuid "874e7ee2-08f7-52fa-b075-9d0504a30ed5" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245547 1034 "24-\\frac{5}{2\\ln(3)}" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245547 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533669 true] [17592186245547 1111 #uuid "15c185dc-f80c-572e-971e-402d1e522644" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245548 1017 #edb/ref 17592186245549 13194139533669 true] [17592186245548 1089 "q-340026" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245548 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533669 true] [17592186245548 1100 "Given the function $y=6{log}_{2}⁡x+4{x}^{2}-3x,$ the slope of the tangent line at $x=1$ is{{field-1}}." 13194139533669 true] [17592186245548 1113 #uuid "e2bb23fc-94e4-5068-ad8c-2bac28d89d6c" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245548 1138 false 13194139533669 true] [17592186245548 1145 "To find the slope of the tangent at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nTaking the derivative, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6{log}_{2}⁡x+4{x}^{2}-3x) \\\\  & =6\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({log}_{2}⁡x)+4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2})-3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & =6\\cdot \\frac{1}{xln⁡2}+4\\cdot 2x-3 \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{xln⁡2}+8x-3\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent at $x=1$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=1} & ={(\\frac{6}{xln⁡2}+8x-3)|}_{x=1} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{1\\cdot ln⁡2}+8(1)-3 \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{ln⁡2}+5\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245549 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245550 13194139533669 true] [17592186245549 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245551 13194139533669 true] [17592186245549 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533669 true] [17592186245549 1041 "field-1" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245549 1104 #edb/ref 17592186245551 13194139533669 true] [17592186245549 1110 #uuid "29cb8dbd-f48c-52ed-9849-93f8f108d09f" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245550 1034 "5-\\frac{6}{\\ln(2)}" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245550 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533669 true] [17592186245550 1111 #uuid "ca43d93f-962c-5867-9383-d3b927df358c" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245551 1034 "5+\\frac{6}{\\ln(2)}" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245551 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533669 true] [17592186245551 1111 #uuid "8c5d6dfc-5e0b-5f82-a0f8-d66383f2bfe5" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245552 1017 #edb/ref 17592186245553 13194139533669 true] [17592186245552 1089 "q-340104" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245552 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533669 true] [17592186245552 1100 "Given the function  $y=4ln⁡x-\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {2}^{x}+5$, find the instantaneous rate of change at $x=2.$ Do not round the answer.\n\nThe instantaneous rate of change at $x=2$ is\n{{field-1}}." 13194139533669 true] [17592186245552 1113 #uuid "e2c81546-e71f-5118-8492-272c58b3d5ed" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245552 1138 false 13194139533669 true] [17592186245552 1145 "To find the instantaneous rate of change at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nTaking the derivative, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4ln⁡x-\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {2}^{x}+5) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{x}-\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {2}^{x}ln⁡(2).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the instantaneous rate of change at $x=2$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=2} & ={(\\frac{4}{x}-\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {2}^{x}ln⁡(2))|}_{x=2} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{2}-\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {2}^{2}ln⁡(2) \\\\  & =2-\\frac{4}{3}ln⁡(2)\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245553 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245554 13194139533669 true] [17592186245553 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533669 true] [17592186245553 1041 "field-1" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245553 1104 #edb/ref 17592186245554 13194139533669 true] [17592186245553 1110 #uuid "28bf96d3-4622-5427-88e4-78f942b675bd" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245554 1034 "2-\\frac{4}{3}\\ln(2)" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245554 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533669 true] [17592186245554 1111 #uuid "a2ecb11f-9df4-5980-805e-ecff46f0849a" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245555 1017 #edb/ref 17592186245556 13194139533669 true] [17592186245555 1089 "q-340105" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245555 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533669 true] [17592186245555 1100 "Given that $f(x)={3}^{x}+log⁡x$, find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n${f}^{′}(x)=$\n{{field-1}}." 13194139533669 true] [17592186245555 1113 #uuid "00bcd86f-d2c5-50f7-a8a4-315cf0884886" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245555 1138 false 13194139533669 true] [17592186245555 1145 "To differentiate a logarithm with base $a,$ we use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({log}_{a}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{xln⁡a}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({3}^{x}+log⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({3}^{x})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(log⁡x) \\\\  & ={3}^{x}ln⁡(3)+\\frac{1}{xln⁡(10)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245556 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245557 13194139533669 true] [17592186245556 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533669 true] [17592186245556 1041 "field-1" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245556 1104 #edb/ref 17592186245557 13194139533669 true] [17592186245556 1110 #uuid "61329a65-511b-5206-bac7-c7f9c1558f79" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245557 1034 "3^x\\ln(3)+\\frac{1}{x\\ln(10)}" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245557 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533669 true] [17592186245557 1111 #uuid "f0478ae9-d95a-52af-be9e-d907429eb223" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245558 1017 #edb/ref 17592186245559 13194139533669 true] [17592186245558 1089 "q-340106" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245558 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533669 true] [17592186245558 1100 "Given that $y=-{e}^{x}+3{log}_{5}⁡x$, find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}.$\n\n$\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=$\n{{field-1}}." 13194139533669 true] [17592186245558 1113 #uuid "2848146e-3aa0-5434-8c1e-21d5642b4d56" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245558 1138 false 13194139533669 true] [17592186245558 1145 "To differentiate a logarithm with base $a,$ we use the formula\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({log}_{a}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{xln⁡a}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-{e}^{x}+3{log}_{5}⁡x) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})+3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({log}_{5}⁡x) \\\\  & =-{e}^{x}+3\\cdot \\frac{1}{xln⁡(5)} \\\\  & =-{e}^{x}+\\frac{3}{xln⁡(5)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245559 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245560 13194139533669 true] [17592186245559 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533669 true] [17592186245559 1041 "field-1" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245559 1104 #edb/ref 17592186245560 13194139533669 true] [17592186245559 1110 #uuid "c095fa52-1272-5aee-8f54-e8ebbaf05a6b" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245560 1034 "-e^x+\\frac{3}{x\\ln(5)}" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245560 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533669 true] [17592186245560 1111 #uuid "001c73a9-6be2-5573-b9af-d22000144c3e" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245561 1017 #edb/ref 17592186245562 13194139533669 true] [17592186245561 1089 "q-340110" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245561 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533669 true] [17592186245561 1100 "Given the function $y=4{e}^{x}-3{log}_{2}⁡x+7,$ the slope of the tangent line at $x=3$ is{{field-1}}." 13194139533669 true] [17592186245561 1113 #uuid "aa34e2cc-02df-5659-bdbd-d89b4f453804" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245561 1138 false 13194139533669 true] [17592186245561 1145 "To find the slope of the tangent at a given point, we have to find $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ at that point.\n\nTaking the derivative, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4{e}^{x}-3{log}_{2}⁡x+7) \\\\  & =4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})-3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({log}_{2}⁡x)+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(7) \\\\  & =4{e}^{x}-3\\cdot \\frac{1}{xln⁡2}+0 \\\\  & =4{e}^{x}-\\frac{3}{xln⁡2}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent at $x=3$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=3} & ={(4{e}^{x}-\\frac{3}{xln⁡2})|}_{x=3} \\\\  & =4{e}^{3}-\\frac{3}{3\\cdot ln⁡2} \\\\  & =4{e}^{3}-\\frac{1}{ln⁡2}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245562 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245563 13194139533669 true] [17592186245562 1000 #edb/ref 17592186245564 13194139533669 true] [17592186245562 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533669 true] [17592186245562 1041 "field-1" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245562 1104 #edb/ref 17592186245564 13194139533669 true] [17592186245562 1110 #uuid "3ab0476c-ced0-566f-b65d-c2395fa7b54b" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245563 1034 "4e^3+\\frac{1}{\\ln(2)}" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245563 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533669 true] [17592186245563 1111 #uuid "db2996e5-0f5c-57b9-a673-8be6139f81d4" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245564 1034 "4e^3-\\frac{1}{\\ln(2)}" 13194139533669 true] [17592186245564 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533669 true] [17592186245564 1111 #uuid "96dd115d-eb77-539d-8e19-9ce168522313" 13194139533669 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-101600" 17592186245472 "q-101600/selection" 175